{"id":"steam-726550","steam":726550,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Form of a Legend","summary":"Form of a Legend is a real time strategy game set on a fantasy world with different races. Build and manage your civilization to make your story a legend.","about":"Form of a Legend is a real time strategy game set in a fantasy world about building and managing your civilization. You start as a group of villagers from the civilization you choose and explore the map to find special places, tribes to conquer, develop your technologies.\r\n\r\n\nPlay against the AI or your friends.\n\r\n\r\nAdd aggressive AI or pacific AI in single player or play with your friends online!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\nDevelop your civilization\n\r\n\r\nBuild, gather resources and research technologies. Then train armies of warriors and magicians and attack! Or fortify your city with walls to protect your economy.\r\n\r\n\nChoose your path to become a Legend\n\r\n\r\nTrain an army and conquer the world or build a market to make trade routes and bring people to your Plaza through fairs that way you will control the economy.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726550/library_600x900.jpg?t=1620297028","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726550/header.jpg?t=1620297028","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726550/library_hero.jpg?t=1620297028","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726550/header.jpg?t=1620297028","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726550/ss_c03c37a607c5848a85f0aa817fc39e490d9651c4.600x338.jpg?t=1620297028","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726550/ss_c03c37a607c5848a85f0aa817fc39e490d9651c4.jpg?t=1620297028"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726550/ss_e6e386ccad412cd689